{
  "book": "mosiah",
  "bookName": "Mosiah",
  "chapter": 21,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 487.14,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.923,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Limhi and his people returned to the city of Nephi,",
      "verse": "21:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 5.103,
      "end": 8.447,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to dwell in the land again in peace.",
      "verse": "21:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 9.127,
      "end": 11.728,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after many days",
      "verse": "21:2",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 11.908,
      "end": 17.341,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Lamanites began again to be stirred up in anger against the Nephites,",
      "verse": "21:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 17.521,
      "end": 21.05,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they began to come into the borders of the land round about.",
      "verse": "21:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 21.73,
      "end": 27.071,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now they durst not slay them, because of the oath which their king had made unto Limhi;",
      "verse": "21:3",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 27.251,
      "end": 29.852,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but they would smite them on their cheeks,",
      "verse": "21:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 30.032,
      "end": 32.308,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and exercise authority over them;",
      "verse": "21:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 32.488,
      "end": 35.599,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to put heavy burdens upon their backs,",
      "verse": "21:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 35.779,
      "end": 38.426,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and drive them as they would a dumb ass\u2014",
      "verse": "21:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 39.106,
      "end": 42.775,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, all this was done that the word of the Lord might be fulfilled.",
      "verse": "21:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 43.455,
      "end": 46.474,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now the afflictions of the Nephites were great,",
      "verse": "21:5",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 46.654,
      "end": 50.694,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there was no way that they could deliver themselves out of their hands,",
      "verse": "21:5",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 50.874,
      "end": 54.45,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Lamanites had surrounded them on every side.",
      "verse": "21:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 55.13,
      "end": 61.678,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the people began to murmur with the king because of their afflictions;",
      "verse": "21:6",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 61.858,
      "end": 65.527,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they began to be desirous to go against them to battle.",
      "verse": "21:6",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 65.707,
      "end": 69.19,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they did afflict the king sorely with their complaints;",
      "verse": "21:6",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 69.37,
      "end": 74.06,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he granted unto them that they should do according to their desires.",
      "verse": "21:6",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 74.74,
      "end": 77.387,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they gathered themselves together again,",
      "verse": "21:7",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 77.567,
      "end": 79.146,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and put on their armor,",
      "verse": "21:7",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 79.326,
      "end": 84.295,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and went forth against the Lamanites to drive them out of their land.",
      "verse": "21:7",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 84.975,
      "end": 88.04,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Lamanites did beat them,",
      "verse": "21:8",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 88.22,
      "end": 89.613,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and drove them back,",
      "verse": "21:8",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 89.793,
      "end": 91.418,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and slew many of them.",
      "verse": "21:8",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 92.098,
      "end": 96.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now there was a great mourning and lamentation among the people of Limhi,",
      "verse": "21:9",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 96.876,
      "end": 99.152,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the widow mourning for her husband,",
      "verse": "21:9",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 99.332,
      "end": 102.351,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the son and the daughter mourning for their father,",
      "verse": "21:9",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 102.531,
      "end": 105.132,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the brothers for their brethren.",
      "verse": "21:9",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 105.812,
      "end": 108.691,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now there were a great many widows in the land,",
      "verse": "21:10",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 108.871,
      "end": 111.75,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did cry mightily from day to day,",
      "verse": "21:10",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 111.93,
      "end": 115.32,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for a great fear of the Lamanites had come upon them.",
      "verse": "21:10",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 116.0,
      "end": 124.359,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that their continual cries did stir up the remainder of the people of Limhi to anger against the Lamanites;",
      "verse": "21:11",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 124.539,
      "end": 126.489,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they went again to battle,",
      "verse": "21:11",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 126.669,
      "end": 128.666,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but they were driven back again,",
      "verse": "21:11",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 128.846,
      "end": 130.332,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "suffering much loss.",
      "verse": "21:11",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 131.012,
      "end": 133.334,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, they went again even the third time,",
      "verse": "21:12",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 133.514,
      "end": 136.068,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and suffered in the like manner;",
      "verse": "21:12",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 136.248,
      "end": 140.474,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and those that were not slain returned again to the city of Nephi.",
      "verse": "21:12",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 141.154,
      "end": 144.033,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they did humble themselves even to the dust,",
      "verse": "21:13",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 144.213,
      "end": 147.324,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "subjecting themselves to the yoke of bondage,",
      "verse": "21:13",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 147.504,
      "end": 149.919,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "submitting themselves to be smitten,",
      "verse": "21:13",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 150.099,
      "end": 151.957,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to be driven to and fro,",
      "verse": "21:13",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 152.137,
      "end": 155.759,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and burdened, according to the desires of their enemies.",
      "verse": "21:13",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 156.439,
      "end": 160.108,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they did humble themselves even in the depths of humility;",
      "verse": "21:14",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 160.288,
      "end": 162.61,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did cry mightily to God;",
      "verse": "21:14",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 162.79,
      "end": 166.134,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even all the day long did they cry unto their God",
      "verse": "21:14",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 166.314,
      "end": 169.89,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he would deliver them out of their afflictions.",
      "verse": "21:14",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 170.57,
      "end": 174.332,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now the Lord was slow to hear their cry because of their iniquities;",
      "verse": "21:15",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 174.512,
      "end": 177.02,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless the Lord did hear their cries,",
      "verse": "21:15",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 177.2,
      "end": 180.637,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to soften the hearts of the Lamanites",
      "verse": "21:15",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 180.817,
      "end": 183.557,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they began to ease their burdens;",
      "verse": "21:15",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 183.737,
      "end": 187.917,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yet the Lord did not see fit to deliver them out of bondage.",
      "verse": "21:15",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 188.597,
      "end": 193.241,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that they began to prosper by degrees in the land,",
      "verse": "21:16",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 193.421,
      "end": 196.115,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to raise grain more abundantly,",
      "verse": "21:16",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 196.295,
      "end": 198.06,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and flocks, and herds,",
      "verse": "21:16",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 198.24,
      "end": 200.748,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they did not suffer with hunger.",
      "verse": "21:16",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 201.428,
      "end": 203.982,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now there was a great number of women,",
      "verse": "21:17",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 204.162,
      "end": 205.973,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "more than there was of men;",
      "verse": "21:17",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 206.153,
      "end": 210.286,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore king Limhi commanded that every man should impart",
      "verse": "21:17",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 210.466,
      "end": 213.717,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to the support of the widows and their children,",
      "verse": "21:17",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 213.897,
      "end": 215.987,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might not perish with hunger;",
      "verse": "21:17",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 216.167,
      "end": 220.857,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this they did because of the greatness of their number that had been slain.",
      "verse": "21:17",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 221.537,
      "end": 226.181,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the people of Limhi kept together in a body as much as it was possible,",
      "verse": "21:18",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 226.361,
      "end": 229.147,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and secured their grain and their flocks;",
      "verse": "21:18",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 229.827,
      "end": 232.567,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the king himself did not trust his person",
      "verse": "21:19",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 232.747,
      "end": 235.023,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "without the walls of the city,",
      "verse": "21:19",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 235.203,
      "end": 237.293,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unless he took his guards with him,",
      "verse": "21:19",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 237.473,
      "end": 242.442,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "fearing that he might by some means fall into the hands of the Lamanites.",
      "verse": "21:19",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 243.122,
      "end": 246.93,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he caused that his people should watch the land round about,",
      "verse": "21:20",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 247.11,
      "end": 254.726,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that by some means they might take those priests that fled into the wilderness, who had stolen the daughters of the Lamanites,",
      "verse": "21:20",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 254.906,
      "end": 258.946,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that had caused such a great destruction to come upon them.",
      "verse": "21:20",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 259.626,
      "end": 263.898,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For they were desirous to take them that they might punish them;",
      "verse": "21:21",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 264.078,
      "end": 267.422,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they had come into the land of Nephi by night,",
      "verse": "21:21",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 267.602,
      "end": 271.131,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and carried off their grain and many of their precious things;",
      "verse": "21:21",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 271.311,
      "end": 273.958,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they laid wait for them.",
      "verse": "21:21",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 274.638,
      "end": 280.954,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that there was no more disturbance between the Lamanites and the people of Limhi,",
      "verse": "21:22",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 281.134,
      "end": 285.639,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even until the time that Ammon and his brethren came into the land.",
      "verse": "21:22",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 286.319,
      "end": 293.378,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the king having been without the gates of the city with his guard, discovered Ammon and his brethren;",
      "verse": "21:23",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 293.558,
      "end": 296.252,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and supposing them to be priests of Noah",
      "verse": "21:23",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 296.432,
      "end": 301.54,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he caused that they should be taken, and bound, and cast into prison.",
      "verse": "21:23",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 301.72,
      "end": 304.088,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And had they been the priests of Noah",
      "verse": "21:23",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 304.268,
      "end": 307.333,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he would have caused that they should be put to death.",
      "verse": "21:23",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 308.013,
      "end": 309.917,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But when he found that they were not,",
      "verse": "21:24",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 310.097,
      "end": 312.233,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but that they were his brethren,",
      "verse": "21:24",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 312.413,
      "end": 315.014,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and had come from the land of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "21:24",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 315.194,
      "end": 317.609,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he was filled with exceedingly great joy.",
      "verse": "21:24",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 318.289,
      "end": 321.354,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now king Limhi had sent, previous to the coming of Ammon,",
      "verse": "21:25",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 321.534,
      "end": 325.249,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a small number of men to search for the land of Zarahemla;",
      "verse": "21:25",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 325.429,
      "end": 327.24,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but they could not find it,",
      "verse": "21:25",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 327.42,
      "end": 329.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were lost in the wilderness.",
      "verse": "21:25",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 330.097,
      "end": 333.673,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, they did find a land which had been peopled;",
      "verse": "21:26",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 333.853,
      "end": 336.779,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, a land which was covered with dry bones;",
      "verse": "21:26",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 336.959,
      "end": 341.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, a land which had been peopled and which had been destroyed;",
      "verse": "21:26",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 341.597,
      "end": 346.984,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they, having supposed it to be the land of Zarahemla, returned to the land of Nephi,",
      "verse": "21:26",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 347.164,
      "end": 349.811,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having arrived in the borders of the land",
      "verse": "21:26",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 349.991,
      "end": 352.359,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "not many days before the coming of Ammon.",
      "verse": "21:26",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 353.039,
      "end": 355.407,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they brought a record with them,",
      "verse": "21:27",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 355.587,
      "end": 358.884,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even a record of the people whose bones they had found;",
      "verse": "21:27",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 359.064,
      "end": 361.386,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it was engraven on plates of ore.",
      "verse": "21:27",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 362.066,
      "end": 366.431,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now Limhi was again filled with joy on learning from the mouth of Ammon",
      "verse": "21:28",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 366.611,
      "end": 369.212,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that king Mosiah had a gift from God,",
      "verse": "21:28",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 369.392,
      "end": 372.225,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whereby he could interpret such engravings;",
      "verse": "21:28",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 372.405,
      "end": 374.82,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and Ammon also did rejoice.",
      "verse": "21:28",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 375.5,
      "end": 378.658,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yet Ammon and his brethren were filled with sorrow",
      "verse": "21:29",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 378.838,
      "end": 381.439,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because so many of their brethren had been slain;",
      "verse": "21:29",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 382.119,
      "end": 386.67,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And also that king Noah and his priests had caused the people",
      "verse": "21:30",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 386.85,
      "end": 390.472,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to commit so many sins and iniquities against God;",
      "verse": "21:30",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 390.652,
      "end": 394.135,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they also did mourn for the death of Abinadi;",
      "verse": "21:30",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 394.315,
      "end": 398.773,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also for the departure of Alma and the people that went with him,",
      "verse": "21:30",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 398.953,
      "end": 403.225,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had formed a church of God through the strength and power of God,",
      "verse": "21:30",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 403.405,
      "end": 407.027,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and faith on the words which had been spoken by Abinadi.",
      "verse": "21:30",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 407.707,
      "end": 410.029,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, they did mourn for their departure,",
      "verse": "21:31",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 410.209,
      "end": 412.624,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they knew not whither they had fled.",
      "verse": "21:31",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 412.804,
      "end": 415.219,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now they would have gladly joined with them,",
      "verse": "21:31",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 415.399,
      "end": 418.836,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they themselves had entered into a covenant with God",
      "verse": "21:31",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 419.016,
      "end": 421.338,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to serve him and keep his commandments.",
      "verse": "21:31",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 422.018,
      "end": 424.433,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now since the coming of Ammon,",
      "verse": "21:32",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 424.613,
      "end": 430.0,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "king Limhi had also entered into a covenant with God, and also many of his people,",
      "verse": "21:32",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 430.18,
      "end": 432.502,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to serve him and keep his commandments.",
      "verse": "21:32",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 433.182,
      "end": 439.126,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that king Limhi and many of his people were desirous to be baptized;",
      "verse": "21:33",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 439.306,
      "end": 442.557,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but there was none in the land that had authority from God.",
      "verse": "21:33",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 442.737,
      "end": 444.873,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Ammon declined doing this thing,",
      "verse": "21:33",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 445.053,
      "end": 447.514,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "considering himself an unworthy servant.",
      "verse": "21:33",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 448.194,
      "end": 452.281,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore they did not at that time form themselves into a church,",
      "verse": "21:34",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 452.461,
      "end": 454.829,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "waiting upon the Spirit of the Lord.",
      "verse": "21:34",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 455.009,
      "end": 459.421,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now they were desirous to become even as Alma and his brethren,",
      "verse": "21:34",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 459.601,
      "end": 461.877,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who had fled into the wilderness.",
      "verse": "21:34",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 462.557,
      "end": 464.879,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "They were desirous to be baptized",
      "verse": "21:35",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 465.059,
      "end": 470.4,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as a witness and a testimony that they were willing to serve God with all their hearts;",
      "verse": "21:35",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 470.58,
      "end": 472.902,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless they did prolong the time;",
      "verse": "21:35",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 473.082,
      "end": 476.379,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and an account of their baptism shall be given hereafter.",
      "verse": "21:35",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 477.059,
      "end": 479.799,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now all the study of Ammon and his people,",
      "verse": "21:36",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 479.979,
      "end": 486.481,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and king Limhi and his people, was to deliver themselves out of the hands of the Lamanites and from bondage.",
      "verse": "21:36",
      "lineIndex": 135
    }
  ]
}